WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.910
- Last year, we introduced
you to a talented young woman

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:06.540
whose dream is to become a
successful broadcast journalist.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.780
As the 2021 Kansas student
journalist of the year,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.940
she certainly was already on her way,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.820
but that's an industry in which
you can use a little help.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.870
All the help you can get, right?

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.480
So we decided to introduce
her to Ken Lindner,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.540
one of the top talent
agents in the industry.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.860
But that was just the first part,

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.880
so let's look back.

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.884
And you're not just helping
Riley for the summer, right?

00:00:25.884 --> 00:00:27.480
- That's correct.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.970
I am committed to helping you

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.100
not only through the summer, Riley,

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.660
but we're gonna do this together.

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.840
We're gonna choreograph
your career through college,

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.020
we're gonna work on
demo tapes, internships,

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.550
you'll be, you know,

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:45.690
helped with and by the
the most wonderful people,

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:48.630
some of the most insightful
people in broadcasting.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:50.940
And then we're gonna help
you get that first job,

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:53.490
and I will be here for
you for your career.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.800
- Oh my gosh, that's amazing.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.730
- That's not all, though.

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.890
We actually have "Access Hollywood,"

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.380
they're taking it a step further

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.810
because we love "Access
Hollywood" and they are so great.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:07.410
They're gonna take it further
with an all-access pass,

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:10.320
so you'll meet Kit Hoover, who I love,

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.020
you'll get to attend a newsroom meeting,

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.910
you'll get to give input and more.

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.882
They're actually very excited about this.

00:01:17.882 --> 00:01:18.715
(audience clapping)

00:01:18.715 --> 00:01:20.617
We have Ken and Riley
joining us now, everybody.

00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:23.157
So, Riley, when we last saw you,

00:01:23.157 --> 00:01:25.650
you were headed off to
college, so how's it going?

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:26.610
- Oh, it's going great.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:28.110
I'm at the University of Arkansas

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.880
studying advertising, and I'm kind of

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.090
trying to decide right now
between broadcast journalism

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.280
and news editorial journalism, so.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.230
It was great to hang
out with Kit yesterday

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:39.750
and kind of see what that
looks like in the real world,

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.910
