00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.700
- Wait, so you already jumped right in,

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:48.780
like at your college?

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:49.680
- Yeah, no, it's been great.

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:51.600
