00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.584
- [Kelly] I did that too,
- Oh yeah

00:02:04.584 --> 00:02:05.977
- [Kelly] you know what, it panned out.

00:02:05.977 --> 00:02:06.810
Yeah, I did that too,
- Clearly it worked out.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:07.830
- when I was younger.
- Yeah.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.447
