of us older than you,

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:16.410
like, make sure you make
time for you as well.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:17.243
- Yeah, that's important

00:02:17.243 --> 00:02:18.455
- Have some fun college experiences.

00:02:18.455 --> 00:02:19.344
- For sure.

00:02:19.344 --> 00:02:22.200
- Ken, you and Riley are
still working closely, right?

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.644
- You!
- Yes, me!

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:24.700
