(Riley laughs)

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:28.684
- Yes, Kelly, the mentorship
is going fantastically well.

00:02:28.684 --> 00:02:29.517
- [Kelly] Awesome.

00:02:29.517 --> 00:02:33.133
- And, you know, we choreographed
steps once we finished

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:35.640
