00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:24.677
- That's the big leagues!
- That's so cool!

00:03:24.677 --> 00:03:25.806
(audience applauds)

00:03:25.806 --> 00:03:26.941
- Yes, it's been great.

00:03:26.941 --> 00:03:28.110
